sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BLO as Business Logic<br/>Orchestrator
    participant TM as Transfer<br/>Manager
    participant SM as SATP<br/>Manager
    participant SH as Stage<br/>Handler
    participant AM as Adapter<br/>Manager
    participant SS as Stage<br/>Service
    participant Ext as External<br/>Webhook

    Note over BLO,Ext: Transfer Flow with Adapter Enforcement

    BLO->>TM: initiateTransfer(request)
    TM->>SM: startSatpSession(context)
    
    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over SM,AM: Stage 0 - newSessionRequest
        SM->>SH: handleStage0()
        
        SH->>AM: executeAdapters(stage:0, step:newSessionRequest, point:before)
        
        rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
            Note over AM,Ext: Outbound Webhook Execution
            AM->>AM: findBindings(0:newSessionRequest:before)
            AM->>Ext: POST /webhook/outbound
            Ext-->>AM: 200 OK
            AM-->>SH: OutboundResult: OK
        end
        
        SH->>SS: newSessionRequest()
        SS-->>SH: NewSessionResponse
        
        SH->>AM: executeAdapters(stage:0, step:newSessionRequest, point:after)
        
        rect rgb(254, 226, 226)
            Note over AM,Ext: Inbound Webhook - SKIP (awaiting callback)
            AM->>AM: findBindings(0:newSessionRequest:after)
            AM-->>SH: disposition: SKIP<br/>awaiting external callback
        end
    end

    SH-->>SM: stage0Complete
    SM-->>TM: sessionCreated
    TM-->>BLO: transferInitiated

    Note over BLO,Ext: Continue to Stage 1, 2, 3...
